title: Butler_Talk
---
<<if $day_count == 1>>
    <<if $is_after_shift == false>>
        Butler: Good morning. Please start your cleaning in the West Wing.
    <<else>>
        Butler: You look tired. The East Wing still needs dusting tomorrow.
    <<endif>>
<<elseif $day_count == 2>>
    Butler: Ah, Day 2. You're getting faster at this.
<<elseif $day_count == 3>>
    Butler: It is your final day. Please ensure the mansion is spotless.
<<endif>>
===

title: Chef_Talk
---
<<if $day_count <= 2>>
    <<if $has_photo_piece_2 == false>>
        Chef: Ah, perfect timing! I was sweeping the kitchen floor and picked up this scrap of paper.
        Chef: Looks like part of an old photograph. Here, take it.
        
        <<set $has_photo_piece_2 = true>>
        
        Alice: Thank you! That makes another piece for the photo.
    <<else>>
        Chef: The kitchen is clean for now. Don't let the fire go out!
    <<endif>>
<<else>>
    Chef: The kitchen is clean for now. Don't let the fire go out!
<<endif>>
===

title: Owner_Talk
---
Owner: . . .
===

title: CoWorker_Talk
---
CoWorker: Make sure you get all your work done today, the Land Lady is strict!
===

title: CoWorker_Drawer
---
<<if $has_photo_piece_3 == false>>
    Alice: Let's see what's inside this drawer...
    Alice: Oh? There is a torn piece of a photograph buried under some papers!
    
    <<set $has_photo_piece_3 = true>>
    
    Alice: I got the photo piece!
<<else>>
    Alice: Just some normal belongings inside. Nothing else useful.
<<endif>>
===